# Optional. The app works fully without this — the Ask concierge falls back
# to a deterministic templated sentence when it's unset, and all
# recommendation ranking always happens in application code regardless.
#
# Set this only if you want the concierge's intro sentence phrased by an AI
# model instead of the built-in template. Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
# and NEVER commit a real value to source control.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. The app works fully without this — Home/Ask/Saved all fall back
# to the existing curated mock event catalog automatically if this is unset,
# if the Ticketmaster request fails, or if it returns zero results for the
# demo window. Get a key at https://developer.ticketmaster.com and NEVER
# commit a real value to source control. Read server-side only, in
# src/app/api/events/route.ts — never sent to the browser.
TICKETMASTER_API_KEY=
